#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/news.rst:520
msgid "Invitation secrets and the options ``--token`` and ``--token-file``."
msgstr "邀请密钥以及选项 ``--token`` 和 ``--token-file``\\ 。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/news.rst:521
